          "name": "Options",
          "type": "FDerivedDataIoOptions&",
          "default": "{}"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "FDerivedDataIoRequest",
      "docs": "Caches the derived data into local storage without loading it. Not executed until Dispatch() is invoked.\nThe size and status will be available on the response. Status is Ok if it caches and Error if not.\n@return A request to query the response with. May be discarded by the caller if not needed."
